    "title": "Five Below",
    "description": "Shop Five Below trends *literally* everywhere now! YES! New to the fam? We\u2019re extreme $1-$5 value, plus some incredible finds that go beyond $5. All waaay below the rest\u2026so \u2018let go & have fun\u2019 with one of the coolest brands on the planet!\r\n\r\nReasons to Download\r\n\r\nEasy Peasy to Use!\r\nWe\u2019re obsessed with extreme value and finding you an unbelievable steal! Experience effortless browsing, fast searching for those specific things that you just gotta have, and quickly find one of over 950 stores nearest you!\r\n\r\nShop Without Worry\r\nYou told us, and we listened! Welcome to an even BETTER Five Below mobile experience! Discover an easier checkout, faster shipping, and smoother shopping from beginning to end! Checkout securely using your credit/debit card, or now with PayPal.\r\n\r\nWhat We\u2019re Bringing\r\nWe\u2019re constantly adding new stuff! Check back often for our latest drops in toys & games, Bluetooth earbuds, fitness & wellness gear, makeup, graphic tees, art supplies, candy, books, room d\u00e9cor & more!\r\n\r\nAll the Latest Trends & Fave Brands!\r\nBluetooth, LEGO, Disney, Marvel, Squishmallows, Hershey, Crayola, EOS, Freeman, Sour Patch Kids, Trolli, Haribo & lots more!\r\n\r\nLove us? Tell us!\r\nWe heart our customers, and welcome feedback to make this app even better! Leave a rating and review! And be sure to hang out with us on Instagram, TikTok, Facebook & Twitter. @fivebelow\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019ve grown up with us, or you\u2019re new here---download the Five Below app to start shopping the newest, trendiest, coolest stuff! (A good decision all around!)",
